{"title":"Hill Giant King","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 30 Hill Giant that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/giants-knucklebone\">Giants Knucklebone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 1 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 234 total, 115–119 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-shield\" title=\"Gold Shield - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a011baeea0e0c4dcdb3b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Shield</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Flawless: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"grumms-knuckle-warmace\" title=\"Grumms Knuckle Warmace - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b2488c3b878505e36b9e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Grumms Knuckle Warmace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/grumm-the-hill-king\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/2d79090579fad662adeb.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Grumm the Hill King</b><span>Lv 30</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Hill Giant: <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth\">Hill Giant Youth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(13)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-adolescent\">Hill Giant Adolescent</a> <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-titan\">Hill Giant Titan</a> <span class=\"muted\">(18)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-behemoth\">Hill Giant Behemoth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-brute\">Hill Giant Brute</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/72e691a3047f1da22bbd.svg\" alt=\"Hill Giant King\"></div><h3>Hill Giant King</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>30</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 30)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Hill Giant</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>118</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>21</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>7.0 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2.2</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}